  "description": "Sure, people change... But this much?!\n\n\"Hey, Jina! It's me, Daesoo!\" Be it love or life, 23-year-old Jina has never been lucky. After going through her 6th breakup, Jina's mom tells her a childhood friend is coming to stay with them. But Jina is in for a shock when she sees that her old crybaby pal has become...a death-metal rocker?!\n\n(Source: Manta)",
